{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29102","headline":"将爲南行陪尚书崔公宴海榴堂 · 许浑","name":"将爲南行陪尚书崔公宴海榴堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝讌华堂暮未休，几人偏得谢公留。\n风传鼓角霜侵戟，云卷笙歌月上楼。\n宾馆尽开徐穉榻，客帆空恋李膺舟。\n谩夸书剑无知己，水远山长步步愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29102.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29102","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}